  "foaf:name": "Blue Economy Rooted in Community &amp; Women’s Lead",
  "sdo:name": "Blue Economy Rooted in Community &amp; Women’s Lead",
  "sdo:description": "Bluence is being developed as an initiative within the blue economy, rooted in communities and women’s leadership. Its goal is to create citizen-driven narratives and tools that amplify coastal and river voices, highlight women-led entrepreneurship, and inspire collective awareness and action. Planned activities include producing visual micro-capsules and children’s stories for ocean literacy, designing inclusive educational content on biodiversity and sustainability, and connecting small entrepreneurs in coastal and riverine communities with market opportunities. Bluence will use accessible, low-code technologies to ensure open access and broad participation, positioning itself as a platform where local voices and global ocean goals converge under the UN Ocean Decade.",
  "sdo:location": "Peru",
  "sdo:identifier": "162.9",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/blue-economy-rooted-in-community-womens-lead/",
